{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/edgewater-residences-eva-real-estate-dubai-islands","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1130,"crm_id":"1816","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Edgewater Residences","slug":"edgewater-residences-eva-real-estate-dubai-islands","display_address":"Dubai Islands","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2026 ","developer":"MGS Development","price":null,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.2975679,"longitude":55.2987701,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Edgewater Residences is an exclusive project by Eva Real Estate, the developer of which is MGS-Development. The tower rises above the picturesque Dubai Island peninsula on 15 floors, 12 of which are luxury apartments with <strong>1-3 bedrooms.</strong></p><p>One of the features of the complex is its architecture. The light-coloured facade materials and the unique arrangement of balconies give the building a surprising and elegant look, while the glass panels reflect the sun's rays. The panoramic windows of each residence offer breathtaking views of the Gulf waters and island scenery.</p><p>Residents of Edgewater Residences are presented with a host of premium amenities that include a gym with state-of-the-art equipment, a children's playground, a large swimming pool, lounge terraces and landscaped recreational areas to relax and reset the mind. In the immediate vicinity of the complex there are a variety of cafes, restaurants and shops.</p><p>The strategic location of the complex allows residents to easily access key locations in Dubai. Dubai International Airport is just 10 minutes away, Burj Khalifa and the largest shopping centre, Dubai Mall, are 20 minutes away, and the Burj Al Arab hotel-sail is approximately 25 minutes away.</p><p>Edgewaters Residences is a stunning location that is ideal for couples with children, as well as those looking for a luxurious yet comfortable lifestyle surrounded by scenic nature. sea and first-class amenities.</p><p>Launch date: 16.05.2024</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1816/images/2024/05/02/Mrxx4EjolTdUh3nTMpKWV14tGnTIGa8JfwlaMTHW.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/05/02/Mrxx4EjolTdUh3nTMpKWV14tGnTIGa8JfwlaMTHW.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1816/images/2024/05/02/2vUPNT2Op8jYg28Gn09Y4YmPKXEDUQtCr2J3NWFa.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/05/02/2vUPNT2Op8jYg28Gn09Y4YmPKXEDUQtCr2J3NWFa.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1816/images/2024/05/02/uhVKVxPD9V0Y85DUh7KuCno8Hn1uLV8J3cpWzvXe.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/05/02/uhVKVxPD9V0Y85DUh7KuCno8Hn1uLV8J3cpWzvXe.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1816/images/2024/05/02/NJpzjqnjHPVYe1ZkrfX4rc2hnHgou78WSwnJxnsl.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/05/02/NJpzjqnjHPVYe1ZkrfX4rc2hnHgou78WSwnJxnsl.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1816/images/2024/05/02/fsJECMd3dGFKxVUUcVGylTP8qWhWMqUdMqngb7mR.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/05/02/fsJECMd3dGFKxVUUcVGylTP8qWhWMqUdMqngb7mR.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2157,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1405,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1593,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"496 sq.ft","media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1594,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"982 sq.ft","media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom 